                                    <h1>Founder-to-Founder Skincare Call with Prashant (2026) | ITD GrowthLabs</h1>
                                    <div style="background:#fef2f2;border-left:4px solid #ec4899;padding:20px 24px;border-radius:10px;margin:24px 0;font-size:15px;line-height:1.7;color:#334155;"><strong style="color:#db2777;font-size:14px;letter-spacing:0.4px;">ITD SKINCARE + BEAUTY PORTFOLIO &mdash; THE EVIDENCE:</strong><br>This article is written from live skincare + beauty vertical work. ITD GrowthLabs is a specialist <a href="/industries/digital-marketing-for-skincare-brands.php" style="color:#db2777;font-weight:700;">digital marketing agency for skincare brands</a> with 4+ published D2C beauty brand case studies including <a href="/resources/Kama_Ayurveda_Marketing_Strategy_Case_Study_2026.php" style="color:#db2777;font-weight:700;">Kama Ayurveda</a>, <a href="/resources/Plum_Beauty_Marketing_Strategy_Case_Study_2026.php" style="color:#db2777;font-weight:700;">Plum Beauty</a>, <a href="/resources/Sugar_Cosmetics_Marketing_Strategy_Case_Study_2026.php" style="color:#db2777;font-weight:700;">Sugar Cosmetics</a>, and <a href="/resources/WOW_Skin_Science_Marketing_Strategy_Case_Study_2026.php" style="color:#db2777;font-weight:700;">WOW Skin Science</a>. Plus <a href="/resources/How_Nykaa_Built_India_Largest_Beauty_Brand_2026.php" style="color:#db2777;font-weight:700;">Nykaa growth story</a>, <a href="/resources/Ayurveda_Traditional_Wellness_D2C_India_Global_2026.php" style="color:#db2777;font-weight:700;">Ayurveda D2C playbook</a>, seasonal <a href="/resources/Summer_Skincare_Wellness_Playbook_D2C_2026_2027.php" style="color:#db2777;font-weight:700;">Summer</a> + <a href="/resources/Winter_Skincare_Wellness_Playbook_D2C_2026_2027.php" style="color:#db2777;font-weight:700;">Winter Skincare</a> playbooks, and 11 GCC city-specific beauty pages (<a href="/services/gcc/dubai-beauty-cosmetics-agency.php" style="color:#db2777;font-weight:700;">Dubai</a>, <a href="/services/gcc/riyadh-beauty-cosmetics-agency.php" style="color:#db2777;font-weight:700;">Riyadh</a>, <a href="/services/gcc/jeddah-beauty-cosmetics-agency.php" style="color:#db2777;font-weight:700;">Jeddah</a>, <a href="/services/gcc/doha-beauty-cosmetics-agency.php" style="color:#db2777;font-weight:700;">Doha</a>, Abu Dhabi, Dammam, Al Khobar, Kuwait City, Manama, Muscat, Ras al Khaimah). Every framework below is grounded in live category work.</div><p>Sometimes a skincare founder needs candid founder-to-founder strategy conversation, not a sales call. This is a 45-minute founder-to-founder Calendly with Prashant Chaudhari (ITD GrowthLabs founder). No sales pressure. No obligation. Bring your hardest question + walk out with clarity.</p>
                                    <h2>Who this call is for</h2>
                                    <ul style="padding-left:20px;line-height:1.9;"><li>Skincare + beauty D2C founders + co-founders</li><li>CMO / head-of-growth at skincare + beauty brands</li><li>Investors evaluating skincare + beauty D2C category</li><li>Serial founders considering skincare launch</li><li>Traditional retail brands considering D2C transition</li><li>International brands considering India + GCC entry</li></ul><p>NOT for: general marketing agencies pitching partnership + product vendors + recruiters + service providers. Those requests better via LinkedIn + email + Contact form.</p>
                                    <h2>Common topics this call addresses</h2>
                                    <ul style="padding-left:20px;line-height:1.9;"><li>Positioning + sub-vertical strategy (ayurveda + clean + clinical + K-beauty + men's + colour + halal)</li><li>Launch tier decision (Rs 15L Boutique vs Rs 40L Mid-market vs Rs 1 Cr Full-range premium)</li><li>India + GCC dual-market strategy (India-first + GCC-later vs simultaneous)</li><li>Attribution + LTV / CAC / cohort methodology + reporting</li><li>Retention + subscription programme design + WhatsApp architecture</li><li>Compliance + regulatory (CDSCO + ASCI + ESMA + SFDA + halal)</li><li>Agency selection + in-house vs agency vs hybrid</li><li>Fundraising + Series-A / B strategy (for VC-backed brands)</li><li>M&amp;A + strategic exit conversations (for later-stage founders)</li><li>Category-defining brand-building + Vogue-tier + celebrity + heritage-publication strategy</li></ul>
                                    <h2>What Prashant brings to this conversation</h2>
                                    <ul style="padding-left:20px;line-height:1.9;"><li>Founder of ITD GrowthLabs (Rs 8 Cr+ managed ad spend across 100+ D2C brands)</li><li>15+ years operating + advising D2C + tech + growth-stage companies</li><li>Published 4+ skincare + beauty case studies (Kama Ayurveda + Plum + Sugar + WOW Skin Science + Nykaa growth analyses)</li><li>20+ published skincare + beauty playbooks (Ayurveda + Male Grooming + Skincare + Cosmetics + India + UAE + GCC + Global)</li><li>11 GCC city-specific beauty page playbooks</li><li>India + GCC + international market fluency</li><li>Full-stack (brand + tech + marketing + operations + finance) perspective</li><li>Comfortable with hard truths + candid feedback + strategic disagreement</li></ul>
                                    <h2>Call format &amp;mdash; 45 minutes</h2>
                                    <ol style="padding-left:20px;line-height:1.9;"><li><strong>Minutes 0-5:</strong> Founder introductions + brand context + your hardest question upfront</li><li><strong>Minutes 5-20:</strong> Deep-dive on the hardest question + candid strategic feedback</li><li><strong>Minutes 20-35:</strong> Adjacent topics + capital + team + geography + attribution + retention</li><li><strong>Minutes 35-42:</strong> Actionable takeaways + immediate priorities + potential next steps</li><li><strong>Minutes 42-45:</strong> Q&amp;A + open exchange + optional ITD partnership discussion (if fit)</li></ol><p>Not every call ends in ITD engagement. Some end in candid "you don't need an agency yet" or "here's a better-fit specialist for your specific need". That is the point of founder-to-founder honesty.</p>
                                    <h2>What to bring / prepare</h2>
                                    <ul style="padding-left:20px;line-height:1.9;"><li>Your hardest current strategic question (positioning + tier + attribution + retention + geography + team + fundraising + exit)</li><li>Shopify URL + brand overview (30-second pitch)</li><li>Recent 3-month revenue + AOV + CAC + LTV + repeat rate (if operating)</li><li>Capital available + team + current agency + freelance mix</li><li>12-month + 24-month + 5-year revenue + brand ambition</li><li>Any specific brand + strategy + operational + financial concern</li></ul>
                                    <h2>How to book</h2>
                                    <p>Founder-to-founder call is limited-availability (2-4 slots per week). Book via <a href="/industries/digital-marketing-for-skincare-brands.php">skincare vertical page</a> Calendly (select "Founder-to-Founder 45-min") OR LinkedIn message to Prashant Chaudhari with brand + context. Priority: skincare + beauty D2C founders with Rs 15L+ / month revenue OR Rs 25L+ launch budget planning OR series-A / B fundraising stage OR strategic-exit conversation.</p>

                                    <div style="background: linear-gradient(135deg, #1a1a2e 0%, #16213e 100%); padding: 40px; border-radius: 12px; margin: 40px 0; text-align: center; color: #fff;">
                                        <h3 style="color:#fff;margin-bottom:15px;">Ready to Get Started?</h3>
                                        <p style="color:#ccc;margin-bottom:25px;">Book a free 30-minute skincare D2C discovery call. We map your brand + funnel + share a customised proposal within 3 working days.</p>
