                                    </div>

                                    <div class="faq-section" style="margin-top:40px;">
                                        <h2>Frequently Asked Questions</h2>
                                        <h3>Who is this founder-to-founder call for?</h3>
                                        <p>Skincare + beauty D2C founders + co-founders + CMO / head-of-growth + investors + serial founders + traditional retail brands + international brands considering India + GCC. NOT for general agencies + product vendors + recruiters + service providers.</p>
                                        <h3>What topics does the call address?</h3>
                                        <p>Positioning + sub-vertical strategy + launch tier decision + India + GCC dual-market strategy + attribution + LTV/CAC methodology + retention + subscription design + WhatsApp architecture + compliance + agency selection + fundraising + M&amp;A + category-defining brand-building.</p>
                                        <h3>Who is Prashant Chaudhari?</h3>
                                        <p>Founder of ITD GrowthLabs (Rs 8 Cr+ managed ad spend across 100+ D2C brands). 15+ years D2C + tech + growth-stage. Published 4+ skincare case studies + 20+ skincare + beauty playbooks + 11 GCC city beauty playbooks. India + GCC + international fluency.</p>
                                        <h3>What is the call format?</h3>
                                        <p>45 minutes. Minutes 0-5 introductions + hardest question upfront. Minutes 5-20 deep-dive on hardest question + candid feedback. Minutes 20-35 adjacent topics (capital + team + geography + attribution + retention). Minutes 35-42 actionable takeaways + priorities. Minutes 42-45 Q&amp;A + optional ITD partnership discussion (if fit).</p>
                                        <h3>Is the call really no-sales-pressure?</h3>
                                        <p>Yes. Not every call ends in ITD engagement. Some end in candid "you don't need an agency yet" or "here's a better-fit specialist for your specific need". Founder-to-founder honesty is the point. Sales-only requests better handled by ITD business team via standard discovery call.</p>
                                        <h3>What should I prepare?</h3>
                                        <p>Your hardest current strategic question (positioning + tier + attribution + retention + geography + team + fundraising + exit) + Shopify URL + brand overview + recent 3-month revenue + AOV + CAC + LTV + repeat rate + capital available + team + current agency + freelance mix + 12-24-month + 5-year ambition + any specific concern.</p>
                                        <h3>How limited is availability?</h3>
                                        <p>2-4 slots per week. Priority: skincare + beauty D2C founders with Rs 15L+ / month revenue OR Rs 25L+ launch budget planning OR Series-A / B fundraising stage OR strategic-exit conversation. Others directed to ITD standard discovery call.</p>
                                        <h3>How to book the founder-to-founder call?</h3>
                                        <p>Via <a href="/industries/digital-marketing-for-skincare-brands.php">skincare vertical page</a> Calendly (select "Founder-to-Founder 45-min") OR LinkedIn message to Prashant Chaudhari with brand + context. Response within 24-48 hours business days.</p>
